imalIntegralOrder318,`PELOrderReductionThree318,`PELReductionResidueField318,`PELActualLevelThreeQuotient318,`PELOriginalThirdPeriods318,`PELOriginalThreeTorsion318,`PELThreeTorsionOrderAction318,`PELLevelThreeCoordinates318,`PELLevelThreeAlternatingPair318,`PELPeriodTorsionPolarization318,`RegularLeftModuleAutomorphisms318,`PELOriginalLevelMarkings318,`PELLevelThreeSimilitudes318,`PELPrimeNormalizerData318,`PELPrimeOrderConjugation318,`PELPrimeNormalizerRelations318,`PELInertiaNormalizerData318,`PELInertiaOrderInvolutions318,`PELInertiaQuadraticEmbeddings318,`PELInertiaRealFixedPoints318,`PELInertiaPrimeWord318,`PELInertiaFivefoldRelation318,`PELQuaternionNormParity318,`PELActualOrderNormalizer318,`PELPositiveOrderNormalizer318,`PELNormalizerParityQuotient318,`PELPrimeRightLattice318,`PELPrimeLatticeResidues318,`PELPrimeLatticeCokernel318,`QuaternionicPositiveDeterminant318,`QuaternionicIntegralPeriodMap318,`PELPositiveNormPeriodMap318,`PELIntegralPeriodKernel318,`PELPrimePeriodIsogenies318,`PELPrimeIsogenyFibers318,`PELNormalizerReductionAction318,`PELNormalizerResidueFrobenius318,`PELNormalizerInnerRelations318,`PELNormalizerProjectiveLevel318,`PELNormalizerPrincipalConjugation318,`PELPositiveNormalizerMobius318,`PELNormalizerArithmeticBase318,`PELInertiaArithmeticFixedPoints318]
